<title>USA: Pollo Tropical Inc Q1 March 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Pollo Tropical Inc Q1 March 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues				 $   15,802,000$  14,594,000</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		1,613,000	601,000</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		  613,000	228,000</p>
<p> Net income				    1,000,000	373,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			     0.12	   0.05</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding   8,220,000    8,140,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 earnings increase reflects decision to concentrate on its Florida base, company said.</p>
<p>Company said same-store sales rose 7.8 percent in Q1 1997.</p>
<p>Periods ended March 30 vs March 31.</p>
</text>
